// AWS Backup Resources Deleted  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1490
// Detects deletion of AWS Backup resources (DeleteBackupVault/DeleteRecoveryPoint/DeleteBackupPlan), inhibiting recovery from a destructive…
// False positives: Backup lifecycle management (should be controlled).
// Source: rules/impact/backup-delete.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^DeleteBackupVault$/i or eventName=/^DeleteRecoveryPoint$/i or eventName=/^DeleteBackupPlan$/i eventSource=/^backup\.amazonaws\.com$/i
